# Reversed from storefront-lamp's own "built assets are committed, servers never run Node"
# convention (user-directed) — this port now builds at deploy time instead (see package.json's
# `prestart` script and MERN.md's Layout section). Nothing under here survives a fresh
# `npm run build:assets`, or needs to: the script creates the directory itself.
public/assets/build/

# Written by `theme:sync --apply` — carries live payment-processor credentials once a real sync
# populates it (see the file's own header comment). Matches storefront-lamp's own
# channel.generated.php convention; the placeholder shape lives in git history from the initial
# commit, but must never gain a real secret in a future commit.
config/channel.generated.ts
CLAUDE.local.md
storage/logs/*.log
storage/cache/*
!storage/cache/.gitkeep
storage/sessions/*
!storage/sessions/.gitkeep
storage/database/*.sqlite3
storage/database/*.sqlite3-journal
storage/database/*.sqlite3-shm
storage/database/*.sqlite3-wal
!storage/database/.gitkeep

